 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IMwclR66XPAQ7kNvwGlDr7Y&_nc_oc=Adoabyp3l2Yi7suyc5vc33V6AMGEe3Ye29jdRsZkgM-NuvI5ta-H32lZ4CjlonmezAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7krhme_DMiPHaCooZ-xUJgHDrGKt9Ulk_01ttYoJmwmw&oe=6A14401E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W21DRffzpIUQ7kNvwFhM80B&_nc_oc=AdqPqZhF9tu3HrQQguEsg9IiK0aQhwrjoMW-6KpsGbO6NXDFQXeXLIGgSZscoLOjMP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4rhAZEPPhB1CwuLbMJ4kkTmH0115qJAYPkPAJlMUT3VA&oe=6A145DC1"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qpfMYIkWnm8Q7kNvwEE7F5a&_nc_oc=AdqOoynvF_PAmJIwArLdEHOin9VFJwCbU33MU8JnnbDo3uBgSWZTeh9WCZaBQ1-fdIU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6kHMoBpG3pdsypfh08RBdsOL84tfMhcEVj6SnR8F7cYA&oe=6A1472BE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XGY7HuH_1loQ7kNvwGQaIY3&_nc_oc=AdpDBxsSgC-VaEDjWnqIRthha9XoJnWcppsmqTLoomPfPyprzj7Um6NsmkikFDcXLpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6QrkpJgz1748U4sEVdDqIe-20korkqq2M7TH8hjiQmXw&oe=6A143EA3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D4oXNG4AFHUQ7kNvwEsT4dn&_nc_oc=Ado6Za7RfdLjPfj8v3trEPFLWEJqJ355Xw1F-WNRG1Ouo82yw4eAm2_y3-1mAzWpyk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rgxzUKm40dw0DgXgwnLo7Mzm04T2poIa0eLTys-qPXA&oe=6A1444BB"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con